@*
    One example of a demo page: its heading, the paragraph explaining it, and the example itself on the
    site kit's sample surface (.bb-demo) - live, with the Razor and the CSS that produced it one tab away.
    The tabs are the library's own BitBhTabGroup, so the demo dogfoods the headless tab component; they
    take the kit's tab-list look (.bb-tabs, which keys off the aria-selected the tabs render). The code is
    shown by CodeBlock - the kit's pre.bb-code, which site.js gives a copy button - coloured by
    SyntaxHighlighter. The code panels unmount while another tab is selected: a page holds a dozen
    examples, and keeping every one's code mounted would lex every snippet on the prerender and again on
    the interactive render, and ship the highlighted markup of tabs nobody opened. The Preview panel
    stays mounted, so a sample keeps its state while its code is being read.

    The heading is an h2, so the docs layout's "on this page" rail lists every example. The MCP server
    (BheadlessDemoSource) reads each block's Title, Description, Code and Css out of the page's markup.

    Tailwind is set by TwDemoBlock: the live sample then sits in .bh-tw-sample, where demo.css gives the
    elements back the look Tailwind's own layers give them (see the note there).
*@

<section class="bh-example">
    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Title))
    {
        <h2>@Title</h2>
    }
    @if (Description is not null)
    {
        <p class="bh-example-desc">@Description</p>
    }

    <BitBhTabGroup class="bb-demo bh-example-frame">
        <BitBhTabList class="bb-tabs bh-example-tabs">
            @if (LiveContent is not null)
            {
                <BitBhTab>Preview</BitBhTab>
            }
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Code))
            {
                <BitBhTab>Razor</BitBhTab>
            }
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Css))
            {
                <BitBhTab>CSS</BitBhTab>
            }
        </BitBhTabList>
        <BitBhTabPanels>
            @if (LiveContent is not null)
            {
                <BitBhTabPanel class="bh-example-panel">
                    <div class="@(Tailwind ? "demo-row bh-tw-sample" : "demo-row")">
                        @LiveContent
                    </div>
                </BitBhTabPanel>
            }
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Code))
            {
                <BitBhTabPanel class="bh-example-panel" Unmount="true">
                    <CodeBlock Code="@Code" Language="razor" />
                </BitBhTabPanel>
            }
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Css))
            {
                <BitBhTabPanel class="bh-example-panel" Unmount="true">
                    <CodeBlock Code="@Css" Language="css" />
                </BitBhTabPanel>
            }
        </BitBhTabPanels>
    </BitBhTabGroup>
</section>

@code {
    [Parameter] public string? Title { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Description { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? LiveContent { get; set; }

    /// <summary>The Razor markup used by the demo.</summary>
    [Parameter] public string? Code { get; set; }

    /// <summary>The CSS that styles the demo. Optional.</summary>
    [Parameter] public string? Css { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Whether the live sample is styled with Tailwind utilities rather than demo.css.</summary>
    [Parameter] public bool Tailwind { get; set; }
}
